2026-07-27T09:35:21.7744185Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:35:21.7744503Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:35:21.7744993Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:35:21.7745724Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:35:21.7746743Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
